<TXSPN>Let me say this in advance. It is a small hint.<PG>
The encyclopedia alone has no effect at all on the progress of this world.<PG>
Whether you look at the encyclopedia is up to you, but it will not give you any advantage in progressing.<BR>
To put it the other way, the References and Chatter...<PG>
That is how things stand.<PG>
